-- INSTRUCTIONS FOR NEW SUPABASE PROJECT:
-- 1. Create a new Supabase Project at https://supabase.com/dashboard (Region: Singapore)
-- 2. Open the SQL Editor in your new project.
-- 3. Paste this ENTIRE file into the SQL Editor and click "Run".
